# Mailspring-style authentication, discovery, and message loading transcript.

C: A001 AUTHENTICATE LOGIN dXNlckBleGFtcGxlLnRlc3Q=
S: + UGFzc3dvcmQ6

C: cGFzc3dvcmQ=
S: A001 OK

C: A002 CAPABILITY
S: A002 OK

C: A003 LIST "" "*" RETURN (SPECIAL-USE CHILDREN)
S: A003 OK

C: A004 LSUB "" "*"
S: A004 OK

C: A005 STATUS INBOX (MESSAGES RECENT UIDNEXT UIDVALIDITY UNSEEN SIZE HIGHESTMODSEQ)
S: A005 OK

C: A006 SELECT INBOX
S: A006 OK

C: A007 UID SEARCH ALL
S: A007 OK

C: A008 UID FETCH 1:* (UID FLAGS INTERNALDATE RFC822.SIZE ENVELOPE BODYSTRUCTURE)
S: A008 OK

C: A009 UID FETCH 1 BODY.PEEK[]<0.1024>
S: A009 OK

C: A010 LOGOUT
S: A010 OK
